== r3.99 (D1): a Use is searched in the entry file's directory, then each
== --path, then each INOX_PATH entry, then the standard library; the first
== file found is the module, and a missing INOX_PATH entry is skipped.
Use Greeting
Use Farewell

Main :
    Greet
    Wave
;
